{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49875","headline":"忆江南 一 · 冯延巳","name":"忆江南 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去岁迎春楼上月，正是西窗，夜凉时节。\n玉人贪睡坠钗云，粉消妆薄见天真。\n人非风月长依旧，破镜尘筝一梦经年瘦。\n今宵帘幕扬花阴，空余枕泪独伤心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}